The hero card is unnumbered. The analytical sections start at 2 and continue through 8.

4. Keep all section headings aligned.

The number circles, headings and information icons must follow the same horizontal baseline.

5. Do not use white chart backgrounds.

All charts sit directly on dark green surfaces.

6. Keep chart legends compact.

The legends are small, horizontally arranged and integrated into the chart area.

7. Do not replace charts with generic statistic cards.

The actual chart visualizations are central to the page.

8. Preserve the data-table density.

The water-source table and data-quality table use small typography and compact row heights.

