- Green: ETc, crop status and actions.
- Blue: rainfall and water.
- Yellow: soil storage and caution.
- Amber: medium-quality data.
- Red: critical warnings, if applicable.
10. Preserve the bottom three-card arrangement.

Historical Water Use, Data Sources, and Quick Actions must appear side by side at the reference width.

11. Keep the dark atmospheric background visible.

